import{_ as t,o as n,c as a,a2 as i}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 720 | Hyper-Multiverse Strong Ones' Post Duties · Transcended-One Training and Lineage Post","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 720 | Hyper-Multiverse Strong Ones' Post Duties · Transcended-One Training and Lineage Post","no":720,"module":4,"tags":["Post Duties","Transcended-One Training","Lineage","Successor Cultivation","Generational Replacement"],"related":["37-Symbiotic Education System","17-Plane-Transcendent Strong-One Standards","75-20%-Activation Strategy Implementation"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0720_模块4-超脱者培训与传承岗.md","filePath":"en/0720_模块4-超脱者培训与传承岗.md"}`),o={name:"en/0720_模块4-超脱者培训与传承岗.md"};function s(r,e,l,h,d,c){return n(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[i('<h1 id="entry-720-hyper-multiverse-strong-ones-post-duties-·-transcended-one-training-and-lineage-post" tabindex="-1">Entry 720 | Hyper-Multiverse Strong Ones&#39; Post Duties · Transcended-One Training and Lineage Post <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-720-hyper-multiverse-strong-ones-post-duties-·-transcended-one-training-and-lineage-post" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 720 | Hyper-Multiverse Strong Ones&#39; Post Duties · Transcended-One Training and Lineage Post&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 37, 17, 75</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-greatest-fear-is-not-being-unable-to-beat-the-enemy-but-having-no-successor" tabindex="-1">Introduction: the greatest fear is not being unable to beat the enemy, but having no successor <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-greatest-fear-is-not-being-unable-to-beat-the-enemy-but-having-no-successor" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: the greatest fear is not being unable to beat the enemy, but having no successor&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Of the nine posts, the one with the deepest time depth is the Transcended-One Training and Lineage Post. Its work scale is not one year, not a hundred years, but <strong>one civilizational cycle</strong>. If a transcended one, during his long years on post, does not cultivate the next generation of transcended ones to take over, his generation is a failure — not because his power is insufficient, but because the network did not continue under his hands. This does not exist at all in old web novels: old web-novel protagonists never worry about &quot;who will manage after I die,&quot; because the author defaults that the protagonist never dies and is always the strongest. Heng Yuan Zhou lists lineage as a core post, because <strong>a civilization without lineage is a one-time civilization.</strong></p><p>Six top-level axioms in this entry converge into the word &quot;lineage&quot;: the collective ascension axiom is directly this post&#39;s parent law — strong ones carry Myriad Ranks uplift; one way they carry is cultivating the next generation; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires training opportunities be equal to all beings; the anti-predation axiom requires the training process not turn disciples into predators; the causal self-discipline axiom requires lineage not be tied to personality cult; the law-first axiom requires lineage content be stable, not privately modified by any generation of master.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-post-positioning-the-transcended-ones-master-school-principal" tabindex="-1">I. Post Positioning: The Transcended-Ones&#39; &quot;Master-School Principal&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-post-positioning-the-transcended-ones-master-school-principal" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Post Positioning: The Transcended-Ones&#39; &quot;Master-School Principal&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Training-Lineage Post transcended ones&#39; work is to systematically cultivate the next generation of plane-transcendent strong ones and transcended ones. This is not one-to-one master-disciple, but <strong>an institutionalized lineage system</strong>:</p><ul><li>Identify potential seed candidates from Myriad Ranks (cooperating with the Guidance Post 713);</li><li>Design long-term cultivation paths for seed candidates, spanning hundreds and thousands of years;</li><li>Provide mentors, resources, and mental escort at key breakthrough nodes;</li><li>After cultivating to the Origin Realm, arrange post internships and cross-post rotations;</li><li>After passing four-dimensional assessment, formally enter the transcended-one sequence.</li></ul><p>This requires the Training Post transcended one to have an ultra-long time view — he may watch a seed candidate cultivate from Sense-Origin Realm all the way to Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm, spanning multiple of his own post cycles.</p><h2 id="ii-four-iron-rules-of-the-lineage-system" tabindex="-1">II. Four Iron Rules of the Lineage System <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-four-iron-rules-of-the-lineage-system" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Four Iron Rules of the Lineage System&quot;">​</a></h2><h3 id="_2-1-no-personality-cult" tabindex="-1">2.1 No Personality Cult <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-1-no-personality-cult" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.1 No Personality Cult&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Disciples are not the master&#39;s private property. Training Post transcended ones are strictly forbidden:</p><ul><li>Let disciples swear personal loyalty;</li><li>Let disciples only learn the master&#39;s manual and not other public systems;</li><li>Let disciples treat the master&#39;s will as law.</li></ul><p>This structurally prevents &quot;cult-leader lineage&quot; — old web novels&#39; master-disciple system often evolves into cult leader and cult followers; Heng Yuan Zhou does not allow it.</p><h3 id="_2-2-no-bloodlineism" tabindex="-1">2.2 No Bloodlineism <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-2-no-bloodlineism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.2 No Bloodlineism&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Training targets are produced from Myriad Ranks by talent assessment, not by birth, race, or bloodline. A plant spirit, a planet consciousness, a mechanical-clan genius enjoy completely equal training opportunities with a humankind genius. This is the republican axiom of Myriad Races landing in the lineage field.</p><h3 id="_2-3-no-one-shot-bet" tabindex="-1">2.3 No One-Shot Bet <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-3-no-one-shot-bet" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.3 No One-Shot Bet&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The Training Post transcended one does not &quot;bet on one successor&quot; for himself. He simultaneously cultivates a batch of seed candidates, letting them grow, compete, and complement each other across different posts. This prevents the common old-web-novel disease of &quot;master picks the wrong successor; the entire sect collapses.&quot;</p><h3 id="_2-4-training-content-must-be-in-the-selfless-dao" tabindex="-1">2.4 Training Content Must Be in the Selfless Dao <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-4-training-content-must-be-in-the-selfless-dao" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.4 Training Content Must Be in the Selfless Dao&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Every lesson the master teaches, every note he writes, every training scheme he designs, all flow back to the Selfless-Dao public library. Disciples are not only teachable by the master — on the Selfless Dao there are billions of &quot;masters&#39;&quot; public teaching materials.</p><h2 id="iii-the-training-post-s-generational-link-with-the-20-activation-strategy" tabindex="-1">III. The Training Post&#39;s Generational Link with the 20% Activation Strategy <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-the-training-post-s-generational-link-with-the-20-activation-strategy" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. The Training Post&#39;s Generational Link with the 20% Activation Strategy&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The 20% Activation Strategy (Documents 23, 75) is not completed by one generation. It requires several generations of transcended ones relay:</p><ul><li>First-generation anchors (Lin Hao&#39;s generation): from 0 to 1, activate the first 1%;</li><li>Second-generation transcended ones: from 1% to 10%, systematic cultivation;</li><li>Third-generation transcended ones: from 10% to 20%, steady-state operation;</li><li>Later transcended ones: maintain above 20%, push higher ratios.</li></ul><p>Every generation of transcended ones&#39; KPI includes a hard metric: <strong>the number of plane-transcendent strong ones he personally cultivated who passed the four-dimensional assessment.</strong> This figure is written into his civilizational weight, as the basis for whether he is qualified and whether he may be promoted to higher posts.</p><h2 id="iv-why-lineage-is-perpetual-construction-s-ultimate-guarantee" tabindex="-1">IV. Why Lineage Is Perpetual Construction&#39;s Ultimate Guarantee <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-why-lineage-is-perpetual-construction-s-ultimate-guarantee" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Why Lineage Is Perpetual Construction&#39;s Ultimate Guarantee&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Of the nine posts, the other eight may be partially temporarily replaced by the system — the Maintenance Post may have automated assistance; the Supervision Post may have algorithmic early warning. But the Lineage Post cannot. It requires <strong>a transcended one who has truly walked this road to personally accompany the next generation along it.</strong> Algorithms may teach knowledge, but may not teach &quot;how not to give up at the most desperate breakthrough node&quot;; automation may give resources, but may not give that one &quot;you&#39;re almost there, hold on&quot; nudge.</p><p>Therefore the Lineage Post is perpetual construction&#39;s <strong>ultimate guarantee</strong>: as long as lineage is unbroken, even if some generation of transcended ones collectively leaves post, the network may keep spinning in the next generation&#39;s hands. If lineage breaks, no matter how perfect the post design, it is a castle in the air.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: lineage lets every transcended one&#39;s lifelong experience settle, not disappear with his departure</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: lineage content is all public on the Selfless Dao, preventing &quot;master privately hides unique moves&quot; monopolistic lineage</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-style lineage is &quot;the master picks one person to pass it to&quot;; Heng Yuan Zhou-style lineage is &quot;institutionally cultivate a batch to take over&quot;</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: training targets are selected by talent from Myriad Ranks&#39; five lineages, not favoring humankind or any one clan</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: training materials, assessment standards, lineage experience are all public in the Selfless-Dao public library</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Training-Lineage Post is the nine posts&#39; most time-deep. It does not pursue how strong this generation of transcended ones is; it pursues the next generation being stronger than this one. <strong>A transcended one&#39;s true greatness is not how far he himself walked, but how many people he enabled to keep walking from where he reached.</strong> Lineage unbroken; Heng Yuan Zhou always has tomorrow.</p><p>In the end, the Transcended-One Training and Lineage Post described in this entry is no isolated case — its causal and energetic traces are throughout filed in the Alaya Network, traceable and correctable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/37-共生教育体系.html">Entry 37 · Symbiotic Education System</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/17-位面至高强者标准.html">Entry 17 · Plane-Transcendent Strong-One Standards</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/75-20％激活战略实施.html">Entry 75 · 20%-Activation Strategy Implementation</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/38-共生医疗体系.html">Entry 38 · Symbiotic Medical System</a></li></ul>',35)])])}const p=t(o,[["render",s]]);export{g as __pageData,p as default};
